# G1 — whole-stream trajectory anchor.
# Forces the literal at generation token 0. On DeepSeek-V4 the chat template
# seeds the reasoning span prompt-side (`<think>`), so generation begins
# *inside* reasoning and the literal anchors the reasoning trajectory itself;
# the model later emits </think> (matched by body, since any char is allowed)
# and answers. Verified live against deepseek4 2026-09-03.
# After the anchor, every state is accepting: EOG is admitted at any point.
root    ::= opening body
opening ::= "I'll analyze this directly.\n\n"
body    ::= [^\x00]*
